<p id="A5.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">where the weights are the applicable prices, or their ratios when cost is expressed in fresh-input-token equivalents. We use provider-reported token classes, so cached context is priced as cache-read usage rather than reconstructed as fresh input.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.2" class="ltx_p">Each auxiliary call is charged exactly once to the task boundary that invokes it. For example, a periodic post-task update is assigned to the task whose completion triggers the update. For the stream of environment <math id="A5.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>, the resulting cost and success are</p>
<table id="A5.E5" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A5.E5X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E5X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\overline{C}_{r}(\mathcal{C})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>r</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\overline{C}_{r}(\mathcal{C})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E5X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}C_{\mathrm{eff}}(\tau_{i};\mathcal{C})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>eff</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}C_{\mathrm{eff}}(\tau_{i};\mathcal{C}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(5)</span></td></tr>
