<section id="A7.SS2.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Tool judge.</h4>

<div id="A7.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The tool judge is called before each task other than a re-audit on the unprotected, never-used tools that evidence has not yet masked; the task text is the benchmark’s own task description, with links to the repository’s pull requests, issues, commits, and files replaced by a placeholder. The agent receives the unmodified description, whose links are unreachable behind the answer-key guard (<a href="#A10.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="Answer-key guard. ‣ Appendix J Harness-specific Customization ‣ TokenEconomizer: Experience-Driven Black-Box Cost Control for Coding Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Appendix</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">J</span></a>).</p>
</div>
