<section id="A7.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.3 </span>Failure-loop Intervention</h3>

<div id="A7.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Both calls read the same digest of the trajectory: its running counters, the last 24 actions, and, once <math id="A7.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is available, the trajectory’s length relative to it. The digest records tool names, commands, search patterns, edited file names, and error signatures, but never file contents or the task text.</p>
</div>
